00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:51.512
<v Vocab>過去最低

00:04:51.911 --> 00:04:54.624
<v Host>The lowest ever, a record low.

00:04:55.223 --> 00:05:08.471
<v Slow>一方で、結婚した夫婦の数は、48万9119組で、0.8パーセント増えました。

00:05:09.271 --> 00:05:18.872
<v Host>On the other hand, the number of couples who married was 489,119, up 0.8 percent.

00:05:19.471 --> 00:05:21.680
<v Vocab>夫婦

00:05:22.079 --> 00:05:23.807
<v Host>A married couple.

00:05:24.408 --> 00:05:33.384
<v Slow>都道府県で見ると、出生率には「西高東低」の傾向があります。

00:05:34.184 --> 00:05:39.704
<v Host>By prefecture, birth rates tend to be higher in the west and lower in the east.

00:05:40.303 --> 00:05:42.680
<v Vocab>傾向

00:05:43.079 --> 00:05:45.216
<v Host>A tendency, a trend.

00:05:45.815 --> 00:05:54.360
<v Slow>東京都は0.96で、3年続けて「1」を下回りました。

00:05:55.160 --> 00:06:00.560
<v Host>Tokyo was 0.96, below one for the third year in a row.

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:03.728
<v Vocab>下回る

00:06:04.127 --> 00:06:07.055
<v Host>To fall below, to be under a figure.

00:06:07.656 --> 00:06:18.791
<v Slow>専門家は、若い人が結婚しやすく、子どもを育てやすい社会が必要だと話しています。

00:06:19.591 --> 00:06:25.879
<v Host>Experts say Japan needs a society where young people find it easy to marry and to raise children.

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:28.927
